# DMW3 PC Edition stage data v1 (edit in-game with F2, or by hand)
# exit  x y w h TARGET [arriveX arriveY]
# npc   talk  SPRITE x y dir "Name" "Line one|Line two"
# npc   fight|boss SPRITE x y dir "Name" level
# item  sword x y
# walls original = walls from the game's own walk map (DAT/FIELD/STAGE/S###TMPK.BIN)
#
# ASUKA CITY - main streets (S200). Same city continues in S202 (south park) and S218 (bridge + east patio).
# spawn: decoded player start of WSTAG200 (descriptor +0x2C/+0x30).
# npc positions/sprites: decoded event actors of WSTAG200 (most common story variant per slot);
#   when an NPC stands on an original event actor's spot, talking to it shows the ORIGINAL line from your
#   disc (WSTAG talk table + USTALK00); the name/line here are only a fallback.
# story NPCs (Tamer Service, Teddy, Kail, Tamer Genji at 1088,288, Black Agumon at the west bridge)
#   live in data/story/chapter1.story.
# exits: west bridge = decoded trigger zone 0x20 (destination hand-picked: forest S400 for the demo);
#   links to S202/S218 = hand-placed at the stairs nearest to their decoded trigger zones.
